---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Research Notes — Perqed" activeNav="blog">

  <section class="blog-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Technical Notes & Case Studies</p>
      <h1 class="header-title">Perqed Research Notes</h1>
      <p class="header-desc">
        Mathematical exploration notes and formal verification logs across number theory, Diophantine equations, and topology.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-list">
    <div class="container">
      
      <article class="post-card">
        <div class="post-meta">
          <time>August 23, 2026</time>
          <span class="tag">number-theory</span>
          <span class="tag">lean4</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="post-title">
          <a href="/blog/erdos-graham-factorial-resolution/">On the Erdős–Graham Factorial Problem: Asymptotics & Lean 4 Formalization</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="post-excerpt">
          An examination of the asymptotic leading constant (C₁ ≈ 4.265293) for the dominant H=1 family and formal verification of 8 theorems in pure Lean 4.
        </p>
        <a class="read-link" href="/blog/erdos-graham-factorial-resolution/">Read technical note →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="post-card">
        <div class="post-meta">
          <time>August 23, 2026</time>
          <span class="tag">diophantine</span>
          <span class="tag">baker-method</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="post-title">
          <a href="/blog/general-cunningham-diophantine/">Generalized Cunningham Diophantine Equations: Analytical Bounds & Lean 4 Verification</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="post-excerpt">
          How modular non-residue obstructions and Baker's linear forms in logarithms resolve exponential Cunningham Diophantine equations in Lean 4.
        </p>
        <a class="read-link" href="/blog/general-cunningham-diophantine/">Read technical note →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="post-card">
        <div class="post-meta">
          <time>March 15, 2026</time>
          <span class="tag">topology</span>
          <span class="tag">graph-theory</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="post-title">
          <a href="/blog/torus-decomposition/">Hamiltonian Torus Decompositions: Formal Results for m=4 and m=6</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="post-excerpt">
          Machine-checked proof of edge-disjoint Hamiltonian cycle decompositions on 3D toroidal grids using decidable universal quantifiers in Lean 4.
        </p>
        <a class="read-link" href="/blog/torus-decomposition/">Read technical note →</a>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .blog-header {
    padding: 80px 0 40px;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .header-desc {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .blog-list {
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .post-card {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 36px 0;
  }

  .post-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .post-meta time {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .post-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .post-title a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .post-title a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .post-excerpt {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .read-link {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .read-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .blog-header { padding: 48px 0 24px; }
    .header-title { font-size: 1.9rem; }
  }
</style>
